%% Lab 09: where the run pauses before a write, and how a reviewer's decision resumes it.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab09_approval_flow.mmd -o lab09_approval_flow.png -b white -s 2
sequenceDiagram
    participant Rep
    participant Agent as agent
    participant HITL as approval
    participant Saver as checkpointer
    participant Reviewer
    participant API as Ops API

    Rep->>Agent: ticket 21 on thread "ticket-21"
    Agent->>API: reads run at once: get_invoice(46)
    Agent->>HITL: proposes file_refund_request(46, 8.91)
    HITL->>Saver: interrupt: thread saved, nothing filed
    HITL-->>Reviewer: result.interrupts: the exact call
    Note over Reviewer: approve, edit or reject
    Reviewer->>HITL: Command(resume=edit: amount 1.98), same thread_id
    HITL->>API: POST /refund-requests (Idempotency-Key)
    API-->>HITL: pending_review, or needs_manager over 100
    Note over HITL,API: reject: no POST, the model reads the reason
    HITL->>Agent: tool result
    Agent-->>Rep: filed 1.98, waits for review
